ale":"The title explicitly says comprehensive review, and the abstract mostly cites example models and modalities. It is about biotechnology foundation-model themes, but not a primary text-bio model.","evidence_snippet":"\"The Role of Artificial Intelligence in Modern Biotechnology: A Comprehensive Review\"; \"AlphaFold 3 ... single-cell RNA sequencing ... Virchow model\""},{"record_id":"rec_000422","paper_type":"application_wrapper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"yes","primary_exclusion_code":"application_wrapper","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"This is a porting and benchmarking study for the existing Geneformer model on new hardware. It is an application wrapper, not a new generative text-bio foundation model.","evidence_snippet":"\"porting, optimization, and benchmarking of the Geneformer model\"; \"single-cell transcriptomics\""},{"record_id":"rec_000424","paper_type":"application_wrapper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"yes","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"yes","primary_exclusion_code":"application_wrapper","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The abstract centers on visual instruction tuning of an existing multimodal vision-language foundation model for survival prediction. That is application-style use, not evidence of a new generative text-bio model.","evidence_snippet":"\"visual instruction tuning\"; \"utilizing multimodal Merlin: A vision language foundation model\""},{"record_id":"rec_000426","paper_type":"benchmark_resource","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"yes","text_bio_bridge_present":"unclear","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"benchmark_resource","uncertainty_reason":"text_bio_bridge_unclear","decision_rationale":"The title points to a Cell O