xt-bio foundational model.","evidence_snippet":"\"leverages pre-trained protein language models for high-dimensional sequence embeddings\""},{"record_id":"rec_002056","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"EC2_no_text_component","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"scBIOT is a self-supervised single-cell integration framework using optimal transport and Transformer-based VAEs. The abstract describes biological modalities only, with no substantive text-language component.","evidence_snippet":"\"a self-supervised framework that combines optimal transport alignment with Transformer-based variational autoencoders (VAEs)\""}]}
